          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nihenga, nimbulila inditsu, ndala yonyene, niyipulukha mwikulu hakari, niyayula nomwoyo omukali, yiri Woowe! Woowe! Woowe! Khubeenabo abamenya mushialo, khulwa amayoosi ketsmzika tsiabamalaika abo bataru abarashiakhupa ta!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.13",
